WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:03.074
<v Examiner>One mark, then four marks.

2
00:00:03.074 --> 00:00:04.866
<v Examiner>Define medication adherence.

3
00:00:04.866 --> 00:00:08.770
<v Examiner>Then list four barriers that may stop a patient achieving it.

4
00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:14.626
Adherence is when a patient takes their prescribed medicine according to the plan they

5
00:00:14.626 --> 00:00:19.027
agreed with their prescriber, including the dose, route and frequency.

6
00:00:19.027 --> 00:00:20.473
The key word is agreed.

7
00:00:20.473 --> 00:00:25.942
Compliance is the outdated word: it means doing as you're told, which is paternalistic,

8
00:00:25.942 --> 00:00:28.143
so don't call anyone non-compliant.

9
00:00:28.593 --> 00:00:30.438
Four barriers, one mark each.

10
00:00:30.438 --> 00:00:31.265
Her own list.

11
00:00:31.265 --> 00:00:36.355
One: they can't get to their medicine, for example no transport to the pharmacy.

12
00:00:36.355 --> 00:00:39.663
Two: they don't understand why they need to take it.

13
00:00:39.663 --> 00:00:44.689
Three: a physical impairment, like arthritis, stops them opening the packaging.

14
00:00:44.689 --> 00:00:47.552
Four: a very busy life, so they forget doses.

15
00:00:47.552 --> 00:00:52.897
Cost is another, and it's one of the main determinants of health: prescription fees,

16
00:00:52.897 --> 00:00:55.951
G P fees that differ by area, and getting there.

17
00:00:56.401 --> 00:01:00.037
And her best response when a patient says I can't afford it:

18
00:01:00.037 --> 00:01:02.704
you don't lend money or drive them yourself.

19
00:01:02.704 --> 00:01:05.917
Refer them to the social worker, or cultural support,

20
00:01:05.917 --> 00:01:09.371
and make sure they get every subsidy they're entitled to.

21
00:01:09.821 --> 00:01:13.859
Adherence: taking the medicine as agreed with the prescriber.

22
00:01:13.859 --> 00:01:15.382
Compliance is outdated.

23
00:01:15.382 --> 00:01:19.883
Barriers: no transport to the pharmacy, cost, not understanding why,

24
00:01:19.883 --> 00:01:22.398
can't open the packaging, a busy life.

25
00:01:22.398 --> 00:01:25.907
"I can't afford it": social worker and every subsidy.
